            "created_at": "2025-09-22T01:26:24.61676+00:00",
            "notes": "What you buy here depends on the enemy composition.  If they have a Pharah and your dps are struggling to deal with her or Mercy or a Genji who's just too good at his job, go for **Tranquilizer** to secure those targets for your team or just to peel for yourself. Your objective is to sleep bounty targets for your team to get ahead if that is the case if they got hard bullied Round 1.  \n\nOtherwise if theres no pesky mobile targets opt for Grenadius pin for that juicy aoe damage to chuck in a tank 1v1 or just to harrass the enemy backline in a team fight.  \n\nShould both be too expensive if round 1 was a bust opt for multi tool or custom stock and should they have a zarya or mei chasing you down its fine to opt out of one blue for Rocket boots and to get around the map better.",
