            "created_at": "2025-09-22T01:26:24.61676+00:00",
            "notes": "This is where our power spike starts to happen!  Now that round 3 has started you're going to wonder why I didnt go for cluster core even though it sits at a comfy 10k thats achievable by selling some items.  It Depends on the match up and map. If your team or the enemy team likes to play close together or its a small map, then its feasible to go for cluster core since you will be able to consistently get CD reduction from stacked targets. \n\n If however both teams like to play spread out or the map is unfavorable then go for pure AP to provide more lethality for individual or a small group to make it more feasable to get a pick on them compared to having a small 2 second reduction if you had gone Cluster core.  \n\nWith these two powers you will be a menance for people diving you making you a mini tank for a few seconds and the enemy health bar chunked!  Make sure if winston is diving you to juggle walk with him and the minute you and him are lined up where the barrier inner part isnt protecting him that is when you nade at realistically 65% hp of yourself.",
