            "created_at": "2025-09-22T01:26:24.61676+00:00",
            "notes": "Now that you're sitting at a healthy amount of ability power (usually 40%- 50%) We can now justify getting Cluster!   Ideally you want to start using nades in 3 ways here:  \n\n#1 :Wait for the enemy team to stack up and enemy defensive cds gone (Defense Matrix/Reinshield etch) then chuck it at em for that sweet sweet damage and you'll usually get at least one pick unless kiriko cleanses it.  But even then thats fine since your nade cd is now faster then her suzus and she now has one less CD to protect her tank with and herself.  \n\n#2: Use it defensively and play like a brawler in a pinch where if most of your team is stacked up, you will effectively have lucio ult on a 4 second cool down making you and your team almost immortal or to just save your tank that is low that burst healing from round 1 is now HUGE and effectively a pseudo suzu with the overhealth it provides.\n\n#3: Use it to peel for yourself and make whoever dive you either dead or run away at 20% HP",
